ES:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Oye,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} ¿quieres jugar al escondite?{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0023:}}Antes{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} encontré un sitio genial para
esconderme, ¡y quiero probarlo!
¡Sé que allí{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} no me va a encontrar
nadie!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}} {{TAG:0003:0021:}}¿Qué me dices, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
¿Jugamos?{{TAG:000D:0008:02CD}}{{TAG:000F:0005:15002800}}
¡Sí, venga!
No me apetece

FR:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Eh,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} tu veux jouer à cache-cache
avec moi, {{TAG:0005:0007:}} ?{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0023:}}En me promenant hier, j'ai
découvert une nouvelle cachette.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Jamais tu ne me trouveras !{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0021:}}Tu veux jouer, dis, {{TAG:0005:0008:}} ?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Allez, quoi...{{TAG:000D:0008:02CD}}{{TAG:000F:0005:15002800}}
OK, je compte. Un...
Non merci. Sans moi.

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Huhu, willst du Verstecken spielen?{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0023:}}Ich hab nämlich eben das perfekte
Versteck gefunden!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Äh, he he he!
Da findet mich garantiert keiner!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0021:}}Willst du's trotzdem mal probieren,
{{TAG:0005:0008:}}?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Spielen wir?{{TAG:000D:0008:02CD}}{{TAG:000F:0005:15002800}}
Au ja!
Nö, keine Lust.

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Hey,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} saklambaç oynayalım mı?{{TAG:0007:0001:}} {{TAG:0003:0023:}}Gezerken{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
harika bir saklanma yeri buldum!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}Oraya
saklansam{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} beni kimse hayatta bulamaz!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0021:}}Ne dersin, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Oynayalım mı?{{TAG:000D:0008:02CD}}{{TAG:000F:0005:15002800}}
Evet, hadi!
Yok, pek istemiyorum.

{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Canım fena hâlde saklambaç çekti.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Dışarıda koşturmak istiyorum! {{TAG:0003:0017:}}Benimle
oynar mısın, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}?{{TAG:000D:0008:02CD}}{{TAG:000F:0005:15002800}}
Oynarım.
Bugün olmaz.
